// The Forge (B-029, plan §19's expansion test — Update 2, data-only): 3x3
// tech-production structure; the Legion's second tier. Fielding the
// Pathfinder, Lancer, and Ballista requires raising one (the production
// list is faction data — factions/legion.ron; the trainable list is
// capped at three by the command card's per-producer row, M10.2 §2.3).
//
// Authoring note: the id sorts AFTER "barracks" in the faction's
// production map (producers iterate in sorted order), and the scripted
// AI's plan resolution (engine ai_host: "Roster from the faction's
// production lists") takes the FIRST producer whose list carries
// attackers — the barracks. The Forge is invisible to the Alpha opponent
// by construction; that property is pinned by tests/ai.rs
// (the_alpha_plan_ignores_the_forge).
(
    schema_version: 1,
    id: "forge",
    display_name: "Forge",
    capabilities: [
        Health(( max: 750 )),
        Vision(( radius_milli_tiles: 8000 )),
        Footprint(( w: 3, h: 3 )),
        Produce(()),
    ],
    cost: ( ore: 250 ),
    build_time_ms: 30000,
    population: 0,
    requires: [ "barracks" ],
)
